{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 鳳凰架構\n周志明｜用不可靠的部件構造可靠的系統",
      "x": -160,
      "y": 725,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🏗 架構演進\n單體 → SOA → 微服務 → 雲原生",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat1-l1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-服務架構的演進與拆分.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat1-l2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "各有適用場景，\n**微服務不是免費的**——\n拆分帶來的分散式成本要先算清楚"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🌊 透明多級分流\n流量怎麼進入系統",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 445,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat2-l1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-透明多級分流.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat2-l2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "DNS → CDN → 負載均衡\n→ 網關 → 服務發現\n一層層把請求導到對的節點"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🔄 分散式事務\n跨服務怎麼保證一致",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 805,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat3-l1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-分散式事務的取捨.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat3-l2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 130,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2PC／3PC × TCC × Saga\n可靠訊息佇列（本地訊息表＝Outbox）\n**沒有銀彈**，按一致性需求選\n（見 [[工具-Transactional-Outbox-Pattern]]）"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🛡 服務容錯\n讓局部故障不擴散",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1165,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat4-l1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-服務容錯設計.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat4-l2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "熔斷 × 艙壁隔離 × 重試\n降級 × 流量控制\n目的：防止故障擴散成雪崩"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "☁️ 雲原生\n把關注點下沉到基礎設施",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat5-l1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1420,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 130,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "容器 × Kubernetes × 服務網格（Service Mesh）\n把分散式關注點從應用碼\n下沉到基礎設施\n（本書一大主題，尚無獨立工具卡）"
    }
  ],
